@startuml P232_oid4vci_issue_user_init_simple

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' Settings
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
'=== Header and Footer ===
header OPEN-DID Technical Specification
footer
  	Page %page% of %lastpage% at %date("yyyy-MM-dd hh:mm:ss")
end footer

'=== Title ===
title
	<size:25>P232 : OID4VCI VC Issuance (User-Initiated, Webview)</size>
end title

'=== Options ===
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"

'=== Panticipants ===
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 500
skinparam MinClassWidth 80


actor USER

box Mobile #OldLace
    participant "**Wallet**" as WALLET <<Wallet>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box TAS Server #AliceBlue
    participant "**TAS**\n(List Provider)" as TAS <<WAS>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box Issuing Provider #AliceBlue
    participant "**Webview Issuance**" as WEB <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Credential Issuer**" as CI <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Authorization Server**" as AS <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
end box


'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' Constants
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

!$refdoc = "Refer to separate document"
!$doc = "Refer to data specification document"

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' Content
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
|||

== Precondition : List Provider Registration ==
rnote over TAS, CI
    The Issuing Provider registers the Issuer with the TAS,
    and once the TAS administrator approves it (ACTIVE), the Issuer is exposed in the wallet's Issuer list.
end rnote

== P232-1 : Select Issuer and Credential ==
activate WALLET
WALLET -> TAS++: Retrieve Issuer list request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M232_REQ : Retrieve Issuer list request]**
    end note
return Retrieve Issuer list response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M232_RES : Retrieve Issuer list response]**
end note
WALLET -> CI++: Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M232_REQ : Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata request]**
    end note
return Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M232_RES : Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata response]**
end note
USER -> WALLET: Select Issuer and the Credential to be issued

== P232-2 : Start Webview Issuance Session ==
WALLET -> WEB++: Start issuance request (Webview)
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M232_REQ : Start issuance request]**
    end note
    WEB -> WEB: Create issuance session
return Claim input screen
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M232_RES : Start issuance response]**
end note

== P232-3 : Enter Claims and Create Credential Offer ==
USER -> WALLET: Enter and confirm Claims (Webview)
WALLET -> WEB++: Confirm input request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M232_REQ : Confirm input request]**
    end note
    WEB -> WEB: Validate input values and store Claims
    WEB -> CI++: Create Credential Offer request
        CI -> AS++: Create Pre-Authorized Code request
        return Create Pre-Authorized Code response
    return Create Credential Offer response
return 302 Redirect (Credential Offer)
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M232_RES : Confirm input response]**
end note

== P232-4 : Credential Issuance ==
rnote across #white
    The wallet performs P230-2 (Retrieve Credential Offer) ~ P230-6 (Request Credential) (Token is requested without a tx_code)
    Refer to `P230_oid4vci_issue_pre_authorized_simple`
end note
deactivate WALLET

@enduml
